{"catch":"撐過圍攻，焚盡亡者。","desc":"Outbreak Compound 是一款節奏明快的俯視角殭屍生存射擊遊戲，每一秒都攸關生死。你被困在一座遭到不死生物佔領的殘破設施中，必須迎戰源源不絕的感染者、搜集強力武器，並善用爆裂物才能活下去。從狹窄據點的防守戰到混亂的最後決戰，敏捷反應、精準走位與猛烈火力將決定你能否生還。","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2026-08-13","genres":["射擊 / 動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/223a3df8475fbd2ebd44e2c6872a350332f097ca476d7800375b62ea9f82094d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3519736f042621b8c83189ec45e6960d859a9dbcfddc7ce55aa04d905f067bf3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0b4bee6b1e30787e1ad85c9120723b468e21a37702c02490460935e2746611c8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3ed25b850aeff485c9ea07c0181b570e1e4f269d6762def45c428c10e87b39a2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/26a9b3d08892bc90b9b0e0c61abb31c320a6a36fa425820fc3bf42608009f605.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/482d9858671c2f32bffb1a7e3adb57fa01552253df55fe14446d6bd88a7e86e5.jpg"]}